cture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1823448eb329e041END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-61e0415bc83a76f8END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_WYR_Circus_ClownNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_Circus_ClownNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_Circus_ClownNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">02c1946e-10dc-4c46-a930-56b0939bb628</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:02c1946e-10dc-4c46-a930-56b0939bb628\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:02c1946e-10dc-4c46-a930-56b0939bb628\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles\" title=\"Dribbles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/25px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/38px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/50px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dribbles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/25px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles\" title=\"Dribbles\">Dribbles</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Fumm,\n</p><p><br>\nWe see it in you: the thirst. The art. The <i>passion</i>. The trail of cold, bloody murder you have left in your track needs only the finishing touches to grant you a place among His favoured. But He requires something truly magnificent.\n</p><p><br>\nA 'circus' has appeared, boasting a collection of misfits and ragtags. But more importantly? A <i>stage</i>. Now comes the performance of your lifetime, and when the curtain falls, the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Tribunal</a> will be watching.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234337\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1855/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31110/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7882/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932021/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.411      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.411      1 -total\n 60.27%   28.573      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.33%   25.285     19 Template:Trim\n 21.38%   10.135      2 Template:Uid\n 16.51%    7.828      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.73%    6.982      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.55%    6.422      1 Template:Ifexist\n 12.27%    5.818      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.13%    5.751      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12831-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234337 and revision id 365731. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}